senses.gloss:
प्रति-क्रिया, f. requital, retaliation, revenge; a re-
turn for kindness received, recompense; opposition;
counteracting, remedying; (medical) attendance;
embellishment, decoration; defence, protection; a
fence; succour, help, care.

प्रति-क्षेप, अस्, m. contradicting, contradiction;
opposing, controverting, contravening; contest, con-
testing; not acknowledging, rejecting.

प्रतिगर्ज् प्रति-गर्ज्, cl. 1. P. -गर्जति, -गर्-
जितुम्, to roar at, roar against, roar at one another;
to answer with roars; to resist, oppose.

प्रति-ग्रहण, अस्, ई, अम्, receiving, accepting;
(अम्), n. receiving, reception, receiving presents;
receiving a bride, marrying; a vessel.

प्रतिदिश् प्रति-दिश्, Caus. P. -देशयति, -यि-
तुम्, to point towards, point out; to enjoin, teach;
to direct; to confess.

प्रतिदुह् प्रति-दुह्, धुक् (gender doubtful;
inst. -दुहा or -धुषा, gen. -दुहस् or -धुषस्),
Ved. fresh milk, milk still warm.

प्रतिद्वन्द्व प्रति-द्वन्द्व, अस्, m. an oppo-
nent, antagonist, adversary, rival; an enemy, foe;
(अम्), n. opposition, hostility.

प्रति-धि, इस्, m., Ved. a particular part of a
chariot, pieces of wood fastened across the pole;
(according to Mahī-dhara) = अन्न.

प्रति-नन्दन, अम्, n. greeting, salutation (Ved.);
thankful acceptance; the act of returning thanks at
meals, thanksgiving.

प्रतिनिवृत् प्रति-नि-वृत्, cl. 1. A. -वर्तते,
-वर्तितुम्, to turn back or round, turn away from;
to return; to run away, take flight.

प्रातिपद प्रातिपद, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. 2. प्रति-
पद्), forming the beginning or commencement;
(अस्), m., N. of a man.

प्रति-भान, अम्, n. light, splendor, brilliancy;
intelligence, understanding; brilliance of conception;
confidence, boldness, audacity.
—प्रतिभान-कूट,
अस्, m., N. of a Bodhi-sattva.
—प्रतिभान-वत्,
आन्, अती, अत्, bright, brilliant, luminous, splendid;
intelligent, acute, shrewd; endowed with presence
of mind, bold, prompt, audacious.

प्रति-भिन्न, अस्, आ, अम्, pierced through, pierced;
separated, divided; in immediate contact, closely con-
nected with (with inst.).

प्रतिमा 1. प्रति-मा, cl. 2. P., 3. 4. A. -माति,
-मिमीते, -मायते, -मातुम्, to imitate, copy (Ved.);
to compare.

प्रति-मुक्त, अस्, आ, अम्, put on, applied;
fastened, tied, bound; clothed, armed, accoutred;
released, liberated; loosed or liberated repeatedly;
returned, restored; flung, hurled; thrown at one
another.

प्रतिरव प्रति-रव, अस्, m. (fr. rt. रु with
प्रति), crying or calling out to; quarrelling; echo;
(probably) = उप-रव, q. v.

प्रतिवच् प्रति-वच्, cl. 2. P. -वक्ति, -वक्-
तुम्, to say anything in reply to (with two acc.);
to point out, indicate, denounce (Ved.).

प्रति-वाक्य, अस्, आ, अम्, admitting or requiring
an answer, answerable; (अम्), n. a reply, answer;
(अम्), ind. in every sentence.

प्रति-वीर्य, अम्, n. sufficient strength or power
for resistance, the being equal to or a match for;
अ-प्रतिवीर्य, unequalled, matchless, irresistible;
अप्रतिवीर्यारम्भ, one who has not sufficient
strength to undertake anything.

प्रतिवृ प्रति-वृ, Caus. or cl. 10. P. -वार-
यति, -यितुम्, to keep or ward off, keep back, repel;
to oppose.

प्रति-षेधक, अस्, इका, अम्, prohibiting, prohi-
bitive, interdicting, preventive; denying, negative;
contradicting; excepting.

प्रतिष्कश प्रति-ष्-कश, अस्, m. (fr. rt. कश्
with प्रति), a messenger; a secret emissary, spy;
a whip, a leather thong; [cf. कशा.]

प्रति-ष्ठापन, अम्, n. fixing, placing, locating;
erecting or consecrating the image of a deity, instal-
lation.

प्रतिसमादिश् प्रति-सम्-आ-दिश्, cl. 6. P. -दि-
शति, -देष्टुम्, to return an answer, reply, answer;
to direct in return; to order, command.

प्रतिसमास् प्रति-सम्-आस् (see rt. 4. आस्), cl.
2. A. -आस्ते, -आसितुम्, to be a match for, cope with;
to withstand, resist.

प्रतिस्तब्ध प्रति-स्तब्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, stopped,
restrained; stupefied; propped up, stayed, supported;
[cf. प्रति-ष्टब्ध.]

प्रतीति, इस्, f. going towards, approaching, drawing
near; clear apprehension or insight into anything,
definite perception, clear notion, distinct conception;
complete understanding or ascertainment, knowledge,
experience; conviction; faith, belief; trust, credit;
fame, notoriety; respect; delight.

प्रतीवी प्रती-वी, ईस्, ईस्, इ, Ved. receiving,
accepting with pleasure; (ईस्), m. f. acceptance;
(Sāy.) = यज्ञ.

प्रातिस्विक प्रातिस्विक, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. प्रति-
स्व), own, peculiar, proper, not common to others;
granting to every one his own due.
